@startuml
!include _sequence-bce-style.puml

title UC-0037: Ver Timeline de Documento (Analisis BCE)

actor "Usuario logueado" as Actor
boundary "Interfaz Auditoria" as VT
control "Controlador Auditoria" as CA
entity "EventoAuditoria" as EE


Actor -> VT : 1. Solicita timeline
VT -> CA : 2. Peticion de historial
CA -> EE : 3. Consulta eventos del documento
EE --> CA : retorna eventos


CA -> CA : 4. Ordena cronologicamente
note right : Control ordena cronologicamente todos los eventos recuperados

CA --> VT : 5. Retorna historia completa
VT --> Actor : 6. Renderiza timeline

@enduml

